            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-30T20:50:55.787962+00:00",
            "notes": "A good alternative to [Beat Drop](item_d3d5876b-bd40-4bd9-9954-c65e2295cc2d), would be [Let\u2019s Bounce](item_2d846a6e-ff59-4ccc-ae90-c78fad3b4d9b) for the big knockback. I've had games where the enemy tank just bullies our tank and so the extra knockback helps our tank sustain a lot more. \n\nThis is a niche situation, but if there's an enemy Queen with [Dez\u2019s Damage Dampeners](item_d55fc98b-d014-4383-903c-a7aa1fb7c619), I highly suggest going for [Beat Drop](item_d3d5876b-bd40-4bd9-9954-c65e2295cc2d). If you picked  [Let\u2019s Bounce](item_2d846a6e-ff59-4ccc-ae90-c78fad3b4d9b), you **HAVE** to pair it with [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98). I still don't recommend picking [Let\u2019s Bounce](item_2d846a6e-ff59-4ccc-ae90-c78fad3b4d9b) against a queen. I'd rather just build beat faster, avoid booping her and not sink money for 1 purple item to SORT of counter her blue item. (I despise that item a lot)\n\nIf no one or only 1 teammate has [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505), buy it. If you have 2-3 teammates running [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505), I usually go for [All-Out Auditiva](item_7e33b7e7-4f7a-4f9f-bc25-39ce2a8f56b2) instead for the prolonged big heals.\n\nIf dive's a problem, [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) feels nice.\n\nIf you can't afford last purple, DEFINITELY keep [#1 Single](item_5c5d5331-2966-440b-b989-aa92187eef97).\n\nIf you can't afford the last 2 purples, stick with [#1 Single](item_5c5d5331-2966-440b-b989-aa92187eef97) and [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6).\n\n----------------------------------------\n\n6/1/2025 [Airwaves](item_8dd41d05-7f65-4795-a179-ec8dc40d7824) item edit: This item is bad to get consistent value per round. As it stands, you'd have to setup wallriding up high to get 25% or 50%. Usually, you're getting 25% more sound barrier at best per game. That's roughly 100-200 more hp from proccing that 25%. I would rather run [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) instead or  [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) , as you get to apply said debuff every 3-4 seconds with boop. Overall, airwaves sucks.\n\n6/14/2025 [#1 Single](item_5c5d5331-2966-440b-b989-aa92187eef97) item edit: I just noticed that when your teammates leave your circle and your aura still lingers on them because of [#1 Single](item_5c5d5331-2966-440b-b989-aa92187eef97), you can use **boop** to give them a small burst of heal from [Crowd Pleaser](item_ae569e40-3194-4681-b1da-c664d0fa982c).",
